<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div align="center" style=""><div align="center" style="text-align: center;"><div align="center" style="text-align: start;"><div align="center" style="text-align: start;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="750" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000168D8330" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="00000000168D8590"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000168D87F0"><td data_liveedit_tagid="00000000168D8A50" style="line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000168D8CB0" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="00000000168D8F10"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000168D9170"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000168D93D0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000168D9630" style="background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="00000000168D9890"><tr width="680" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000168D9AF0"><td align="center" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000168D9D50" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: center; height: 60px; width: 680px;"><div data_liveedit_tagid="00000000168D9FB0" style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div><div data_liveedit_tagid="00000000168DA5A0" style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Earn Points. Save on Flights. Manage Travel</font></div><div data_liveedit_tagid="00000000168DA930" style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000168DB630" style="width: 680px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="00000000168DB890"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000168DBAF0"><td data_liveedit_tagid="00000000168DBD50" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/home.html" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img border="0" src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/QBR_eDM_Banner.jpg" title="Qantas Business Rewards" style="width: 680px;"></font></a></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000168DC8E0"><td data_liveedit_tagid="00000000168DCB40" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/home.html" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img border="0" src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/hero-images/qbr/qbr-obt-launch-680x400.jpg" style="width: 680px;"></font></a></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="main-content" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000168DD940" style="text-align: center; width: 600px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="00000000168DDBA0"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000168DDE00"><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000168DE060" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: left;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000168DE510"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="00000000168DE770"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000168DE9D0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000168DEC30" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 30px; height: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B6F8F0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B6FB50" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 16pt; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Introducing the&nbsp;<span data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B6FDB0" style="color: rgb(228, 0, 0);">new features</span>&nbsp;in your Business Account</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B703A0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B70600" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B70AC0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B70D20" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Hi {!Contact.FirstName},</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B711E0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B71440" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B71900"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B71B60" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">It was great to speak to you earlier. As discussed, we are very excited to have launched our new features in your Qantas Business Rewards Account. Below I have included an overview of the benefits included as part of your Qantas Business Rewards membership. Within your Business Account you can now easily book and manage flights, hotels and car hire for your business, in addition to creating and managing your business travel policy, accessing real-time reporting, exclusive flight savings, partner offers and more.</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B71EF0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B72150" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 25px; height: 25px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B72860"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B72AC0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" height="50px" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B72D20"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B72F80"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B731E0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B73440"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B736A0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B73900" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; height: 50px;"><img width="48px;" src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/icons/qbr-icon-business-account-48x48.png" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000168DC0E0" style="margin: 0px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block; width: 48px; text-align: center;"></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B743A0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; width: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B74860"></font></td><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B74CF0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B74F50"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B751B0"><td align="left" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B75410" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B75670">Easy booking</strong><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B758D0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B759E0">Discover a seamless booking experience with the ability to easily book and manage your business' flights, hotels and car hire all in one place. Enjoy the flexibility to book each component separately or as one comprehensive trip. Plus, you'll continue to earn Qantas Points* for your business in addition to your travelers and save up to 10% on the base fare of selected flights<sup data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B75C20" style="font-size: 9px; line-height: 8px;">~</sup>.<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B75FB0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B760C0">Discover more about how to book and manage your business trips&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/news/how-to-guides/book-and-manage-trips.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B76300" style="color: rgb(228, 0, 0); border: 0px;">here</a>.</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B77260"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B774C0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 25px; height: 25px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B77BD0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B77E30" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B78090"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B782F0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B78550" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B787B0"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B78A10"><td align="left" valign="middle" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B78C70" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><img src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/icons/qbr-icon-travel-policy-48x48.png" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B79120" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block; width: 48px; text-align: center;"></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B79820" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; width: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B79CE0"></font></td><td align="center" valign="middle" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B7A170" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; vertical-align: middle; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B7A3D0"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B7A630"><td align="left" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B7A890" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B7AAF0">Travel Policy</strong><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B7AD50"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B7AE60">Set up a travel policy that works for your business. Whether you only want to offer premium cabins on longer flights, hotels with a flexible cancellation policy, or bookings at a certain price, you can create dynamic rules, so each policy is as firm or flexible as your business needs require.<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B7B0A0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B7B1B0">Learn about how to create your travel policy&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/news/how-to-guides/create-default-travel-policy.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B7B3F0" style="color: rgb(228, 0, 0); border: 0px;">here</a>.</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B7C350"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B7C5B0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 25px; height: 25px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B7CCC0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B7CF20" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B7D180"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B7D3E0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B7D640" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B7D8A0"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B7DB00"><td align="left" valign="middle" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B7DD60" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><img src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/icons/qbr-icon-reporting-48x48.png" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B7E210" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block; width: 48px; text-align: center;"></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B7E910" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; width: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B7EDD0"></font></td><td align="center" valign="middle" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B7F260" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; vertical-align: middle; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B91140"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B913A0"><td align="left" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B91600" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B91860">Real-time Reporting and Analytics</strong><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B91AC0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B91BD0">Gain greater visibility and transparency with real-time reporting across your teams' booking behaviour straight from your Qantas Business Rewards Account, this can include spend and policy compliance, across travel categories like flights, hotels and car hire. Plus, easily identify team travel trends to help optimise your business travel and download reports when needed. The information you can view within your reporting may vary based on how you make your bookings.<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B91E10"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B91F20">View your real-time reporting&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/qbr/reports" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B92160" style="color: rgb(228, 0, 0); border: 0px;">here</a>.</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B930C0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B93320" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 25px; height: 25px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B937E0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B93A40" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">These features are available now and are all included as part of your Qantas Business Rewards membership. Find out more below about your benefits, including your member flights savings and the exclusive Qantas Club discount available for you and your teams.<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B93CA0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B93DB0">Don’t forget that the more you fly, the more you save! Be sure to include both your ABN and the traveller’s Qantas Frequent Flyer number into every booking to ensure your business earns 15,000 business Qantas Points from flights per year to retain Level 2, or 80,000 business Qantas Points to reach Level 3 to access more benefits.</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B94250"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B944B0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B94BC0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B94E20" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" height="50px" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B95080"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B952E0"><td align="left" valign="middle" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B95540" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B957A0"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B95A00"><td align="left" valign="middle" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B95C60" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; height: 50px;"><img src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/icons/icon-flights.png" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B96110" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block; text-align: center;"></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B96810" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; width: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B96CD0"></font></td><td align="center" valign="middle" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B97160" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; vertical-align: middle; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B973C0"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B97620"><td align="left" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B97880" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B97AE0">Fly more, save more</strong><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B97D40">Save up to 8% off the base fare of selected flights and up to 3% off Red e-Deals.<sup data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B97F80" style="font-size: 9px; line-height: 8px;">~</sup></font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B98EE0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B99140" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 25px; height: 25px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B99850"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B99AB0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B99D10"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B99F70"><td align="left" valign="middle" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B9A1D0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B9A430"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B9A690"><td align="left" valign="middle" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B9A8F0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; vertical-align: middle; padding: 0px;"><img src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/icons/icon-points.png" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B9ADA0" style="vertical-align: middle; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block; width: 48px; text-align: center;"></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B9B4A0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; width: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B9B960"></font></td><td align="center" valign="middle" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B9BDF0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; vertical-align: middle; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B9C050"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B9C2B0"><td align="left" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B9C510" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B9C770">More Qantas Points</strong><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B9C9D0">As a Qantas Business Rewards member you can earn Qantas Points* for your business on top of the points and Status Credits you and your employees earn as a Frequent Flyer.<sup data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B9CC10" style="font-size: 9px; line-height: 8px;">#</sup></font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B9DB70"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B9DDD0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 10px; height: 10px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B9E4E0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B9E740" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B9E9A0"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B9EC00"><td align="left" valign="middle" width="48px;" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B9EE60" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B9F0C0"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B9F320"><td align="left" valign="middle" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016B9F580" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; vertical-align: middle; padding: 0px; width: 48px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BA0150" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; width: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BA0610"></font></td><td align="center" valign="middle" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BA0AA0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; fo