0016BAF260">Flyer Bonus</strong><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BAF4C0">250 bonus Qantas Points per booking for Frequent Flyers<sup data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BAF700" style="font-size: 9px; line-height: 8px;">+</sup>, every time they fly for work, on top of the points and Status Credits they already earn.<sup data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BAFA90" style="font-size: 9px; line-height: 8px;">#</sup></font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BB09F0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BB0C50" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 25px; height: 25px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BF3150"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BF33B0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><a class="two" href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/earn-points-and-save-on-flights.html" title="Learn more" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BF3610" style="color: rgb(228, 0, 0); border: 0px; text-decoration-line: none !important;">Learn more</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;<a class="two" href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/earn-points-and-save-on-flights.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BF3AD0" style="border: 0px; color: rgb(228, 0, 0) !important; text-decoration-line: none !important;"><img border="0" title="" alt="" src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/other/cta-arrow-5px.jpg" width="4" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BF3D30" style="display: inline-block;"></a></font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BF4300"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BF4560" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial